{"abstract":"Purpose: Increasing genomics-based evidence suggests that synchronous endometrial and ovarian cancer (SEOC) represents clonally related primary and metastatic tumors. A systematic analysis of the global protein landscape of SEOCs, heretofore lacking, could reveal functional and disease-specific consequences of known genetic alterations, the directionality of metastasis, and accurate histologic markers to distinguish SEOCs from single-site tumors. Experimental Design: We performed a systematic proteogenomic analysis of 29 patients diagnosed with SEOC at three international gynecologic oncology treatment centers (Chicago, Vancouver, and Tübingen). For direct comparison with single-site tumors, we included 9 patients with single-site endometrioid ovarian and 26 patients with single-site endometrioid endometrial cancer (EEC). For all 64 patients, we performed sequencing of a 275-gene cancer panel combined with compartment-resolved mass spectrometry–based proteomics of consecutive tissue sections to compare global (6,000+ proteins), tumor, and stromal proteomes. Results: DNA-based panel sequencing confirmed that most SEOCs are clonally related. Global proteome profiling uncovered pronounced differences between SEOCs and single tumors and underscored the importance of the stromal proteome in defining and identifying SEOCs. We identified molecularly unique SEOC stromal proteomes, which were globally more related to single endometrial cancers. We finally derived a proteomic predictor distinguishing SEOCs from single-site ovarian and uterine tumors. Conclusions: The integrated proteogenomic data show that SEOCs are distinguishable from endometrioid endometrial or endometrioid ovarian cancer. Based on their proteogenomic similarity to EECs, we conclude that most SEOCs represent primary EECs that have metastasized to the ovary.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Coscia, Fabian","Nielsen, Annelaura Bach","Weigert, Melanie","Watters, Karen","Javellana, Melissa","Anglesio, Michael","Yamada, S. Diane","Lastra, Ricardo R.","Mann, Matthias","Lengyel, Ernst"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-818664"],"filters":{"added":"2025-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Canada","Germany","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Max Planck Institute of Biochemistry","The University of Chicago","University of British Columbia"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a proteogenomic view of synchronous endometrioid endometrial and ovarian cancer","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-818664","identifier":[{"id":"40145935","type":"pmid"},{"id":"105007804611","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-1dec70ea-3f57-4ee0-bfc8-58308d7606c1"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-5911E3C374FFD260C1469D055E84EE1D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Novo Nordisk Foundation Center for Protein Research, Mann Group","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Novo Nordisk Foundation Center for Protein Research, Proteomics Program"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"the university of chicago","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"The University of Chicago","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"ca","key":"university of british columbia","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of British Columbia","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"de","key":"max planck institute of biochemistry","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Max Planck Institute of Biochemistry","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Fabian","key":"cosciapau","last":"Coscia","locid":"a95a0078-640b-4ef4-9f07-15ee9bb03fe7","name":"Coscia, Fabian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Annelaura B.","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"2a42eff8-3176-4b59-8e7c-3857eb418d8b","name":"Nielsen, Annelaura Bach","name_org":"Nielsen, Annelaura B.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Melanie","key":"weigertpau","last":"Weigert","name":"Weigert, Melanie","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Karen","key":"watterspau","last":"Watters","name":"Watters, Karen","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Melissa","key":"javellanapau","last":"Javellana","name":"Javellana, Melissa","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Michael","key":"anglesiopau","last":"Anglesio","name":"Anglesio, Michael","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"S. Diane","key":"yamadapau","last":"Yamada","name":"Yamada, S. Diane","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Ricardo R.","key":"lastrapau","last":"Lastra","name":"Lastra, Ricardo R.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 4","first":"Matthias","key":"mannpau","last":"Mann","locid":"f463f571-68c5-44fb-bff1-bb9d748fcda8","name":"Mann, Matthias","orcid":"0000-0003-1292-4799","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Ernst","key":"lengyelpau","last":"Lengyel","name":"Lengyel, Ernst","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["40145935"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1158/1078-0432.ccr-24-1763","issn":["10780432","15573265"],"issn_org":["10780432"],"issue":"11","journal":"Clinical Cancer Research","pages":"2230-2240","status":"p","title":"Clinical Cancer Research","volume":"31"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-105007804611"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-1dec70ea-3f57-4ee0-bfc8-58308d7606c1"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A Proteogenomic View of Synchronous Endometrioid Endometrial and Ovarian Cancer","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-818664","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVES: To enhance clinical and multicentre research outcomes in systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE), standardised documentation of patient- and disease-related features is important. The aim of this European Alliance of Associations for Rheumatology (EULAR) taskforce was to define a core set of essential items for the comprehensive care of SLE patients in clinical practice, with an extension for vital elements required for translational and observational research. METHODS: A multidisciplinary EULAR task force group engaged in a multistep approach including a 4-round Delphi survey and a face-to-face meeting. RESULTS: Twenty-five stakeholders from 14 different countries participated. During the process, the initial list of 99 items was reduced to 73 items for inclusion in the clinical core dataset and 8 additional items for research extension. The items were grouped in the domains 'general', 'disease activity', 'disease history', 'disease damage', 'comorbidities', 'patient reported outcomes', 'laboratory markers', 'outcomes', and 'treatment', with suggested frequencies of assessment. CONCLUSIONS: The presented clinical core dataset and its research extension are designed to improve SLE patient care and facilitate collaborative research by ensuring the comparability of datasets and cohort descriptions. This initiative lays the foundation for the establishment of a global SLE data space and has the potential to expedite the implementation of personalised medicine in SLE care.","author_count":25,"contributors":["Mucke, Johanna","Bertsias, George","Aringer, Martin","Arnaud, Laurent","Boström, Carina","Cervera, Ricard","Chehab, Gamal","Czirják, László","Dreyer, Lene","Inês, Luís","Jacobsen, Søren","Nielsen, Charite Kjaerside","Marasco, Emiliano","Mosca, Marta","Myllys, Kirsi","Pamfil, Cristina","Pego-Reigosa, Jose M","Richter, Jutta G","Sciascia, Savino","Tamirou, Farah","Tsang-A-Sjoe, Michel","Vital, Edward M","Van Vollenhoven, Ronald","Wincup, Chris","Schneider, Matthias"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-823323"],"filters":{"added":"2025-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corpau":["Taskforce for development of EULAR recommendations for a core dataset to support clinical care and translational and observational research in systemic lupus erythematosus"],"corresponding_author":["Mucke, Johanna"],"country":["Belgium","France","Germany","Greece","Hungary","Italy","Netherlands","Portugal","Romania","Spain","Sweden","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Amsterdam Rheumatology and Immunology Center","Cliniques Universitaires Saint-Luc","Coimbra University Hospital","Heinrich Heine University Düsseldorf","IRCCS Ospedale pediatrico Bambino Gesù - Roma","Iuliu Hatieganu University of Medicine and Pharmacy","Karolinska Institutet","King's College London","Kliniken Essen-Mitte","Lupus Europe","Strasbourg University Hospital","Technische Universität Dresden","University Hospital Complex of Vigo","University of Barcelona","University of Crete","University of Leeds","University of Pecs","University of Pisa"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"eular recommendations for a core dataset to support clinical care and translational and observational research in systemic lupus erythematosus","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ard.2025.07.001","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-823323","identifier":[{"id":"105013796953","type":"scopus"},{"id":"40841299","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-30102aff-588e-4e80-b6e8-e1353134913a"],"lang":"English