-133","publisher":"American Medical Association","status":"p","title":"JAMA Neurology","volume":"81"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85181010660"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-9edbc162-ad52-4150-8262-93a5c8d8f2c2","sdu-37590af7-2ee8-43c8-a64e-db7db1bd211d"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Hypothermia vs Normothermia in Patients with Cardiac Arrest and Nonshockable Rhythm : A Meta-Analysis","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-741961","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Introduction: Airway management is a critical component of out-of-hospital cardiac arrest (OHCA) resuscitation. The primary aim of this study was to describe pre-hospital airway management in adult patients post-OHCA. Secondary aims were to investigate whether tracheal intubation (TI) versus use of supraglottic airway device (SGA) was associated with patients’ outcomes, including ventilator-free days within 26 days of randomization, 6 months neurological outcome and mortality. Methods: Secondary analysis of the Target Temperature Management-2 (TTM2) trial conducted in 13 countries, including adult patients with OHCA and return of spontaneous circulation, with data available on pre-hospital airway management. A multivariate logistic regression model with backward stepwise selection was employed to assess whether TI versus SGA was associated with outcomes. Results: Of the 1900 TTM2 trial patients, 1702 patients (89.5%) were included, with a mean age of 64 years (Standard Deviation, SD = 13.53); 79.1% were males. Pre-hospital airway management was SGA in 484 (28.4%), and TI in 1218 (71.6%) patients. At hospital admission, 87.8% of patients with SGA and 98.5% with TI were mechanically ventilated (p < 0.001). In the multivariate analysis, TI in comparison with SGA was not independently associated with an increase in ventilator-free days within 26 days of randomization, improved neurological outcomes, or decreased mortality. The hazard ratio for mortality with TI vs. SGA was 1.06, 95%Confidence Interval (CI) 0.88–1.28, p = 0.54. Conclusions: In the multicentre randomized TTM2-trial including patients with OHCA, most patients received prehospital endotracheal intubation to manage their airway. The choice of pre-hospital airway device was not independently associated with patient clinical outcomes. Trial registration number: NCT02908308.","author_count":29,"contributors":["Battaglini, Denise","Schiavetti, Irene","Ball, Lorenzo","Jakobsen, Janus Christian","Lilja, Gisela","Friberg, Hans","Wendel-Garcia, Pedro David","Young, Paul J.","Eastwood, Glenn","Chew, Michelle S.","Unden, Johan","Thomas, Matthew","Joannidis, Michael","Nichol, Alistar","Lundin, Andreas","Hollenberg, Jacob","Hammond, Naomi","Saxena, Manoj","Martin, Annborn","Solar, Miroslav","Taccone, Fabio Silvio","Dankiewicz, Josef","Nielsen, Niklas","Morten Grejs, Anders","Wise, Matt P.","Hängghi, Matthias","Smid, Ondrej","Patroniti, Nicolò","Robba, Chiara"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-761757"],"filters":{"added":"2024-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"corpau":["the TTM2-trial investigators"],"corresponding_author":["Battaglini, Denise"],"country":["Australia","Austria","Belgium","Czechia","Ireland","Italy","New Zealand","Sweden","Switzerland","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Austin Hospital","Charles University","General Teaching Hospital","IRCCS Azienda Ospedaliera Universitaria San Martino IST","Karolinska Institute","Linköping University","Lund University","Medical Research Institute of New Zealand","Medical University of Innsbruck","Monash University","Skåne University Hospital","St. Vincent’s University Hospital","University Hospital Hradec Králové","University Hospital Wales","University Hospital Zurich","University Hospital of Bern","University Hospitals Bristol and Weston NHS Foundation Trust","University of Genoa","University of Gothenburg","University of Melbourne","University of New South Wales","Université Libre de Bruxelles","Wellington Hospital"],"keyword":["Aged","Airway Management","Airway Management methods","Airway devices","Cardiac arrest","Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation methods","Emergency Medical Services methods","Female","Humans","Hypothermia Induced methods","Intubation Intratracheal methods","Male","Middle Aged","Out of Hospital Cardiac Arrest therapy","Outcome endotracheal intubation","Supraglottic device"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"association between early airway intervention in the pre hospital setting and outcomes in out of hospital cardiac arrest patients a post hoc analysis of the target temperature management 000000000002 ttm000000000002 trial","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85204111354","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-761757","identifier":[{"id":"85204111354","type":"scopus"},{"id":"39244144","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-68018bf4-43c1-412c-816d-bd26e41e8ccc","sdu-b3f12fa2-9c66-4c9e-81e6-1aaf0342afa9"],"keyword":["Aged","Airway Management/methods","Airway devices","Airway management","Cardiac arrest","Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation/methods","Emergency Medical Services/methods","Female","Humans","Hypothermia, Induced/methods","Intubation, Intratracheal/methods","Male","Middle Aged","Out-of-Hospital Cardiac Arrest/therapy","Outcome, endotracheal intubation","Supraglottic device"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-200B0F25A628F5FB6514D42D956999E0"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"it","key":"irccs azienda ospedaliera universitaria san martino ist","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"IRCCS Azienda Ospedaliera Universitaria San Martino IST","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"it","key":"university of genoa","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Genoa","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Euro