{"abstract":"Correction to: Nature Genetics. Published online 3 April 2023. In the version of this article originally published, the surname of author Stefan Johansson was misspelled as Johanson. In the abstract and “Genome-wide association analyses” section of the Results, the number of loci associated with preterm birth was shown as six instead of seven. In addition, there was a production error in the Figure 1a y-axis units shown below 0, where “10” and “20” were shown as negative numbers. The errors have been corrected in the HTML and PDF versions of the article.","author_count":50,"contributors":["Solé-Navais, Pol","Flatley, Christopher","Steinthorsdottir, Valgerdur","Vaudel, Marc","Juodakis, Julius","Chen, Jing","Laisk, Triin","LaBella, Abigail L.","Westergaard, David","Bacelis, Jonas","Brumpton, Ben","Skotte, Line","Borges, Maria C.","Helgeland, Øyvind","Mahajan, Anubha","Wielscher, Matthias","Lin, Frederick","Briggs, Catherine","Wang, Carol A.","Moen, Gunn Helen","Beaumont, Robin N.","Bradfield, Jonathan P.","Abraham, Abin","Thorleifsson, Gudmar","Gabrielsen, Maiken E.","Ostrowski, Sisse R.","Modzelewska, Dominika","Nohr, Ellen A","Hypponen, Elina","Srivastava, Amit","Talbot, Octavious","Allard, Catherine","Williams, Scott M.","Menon, Ramkumar","Shields, Beverley M.","Sveinbjornsson, Gardar","Xu, Huan","Melbye, Mads","Lowe, William","Bouchard, Luigi","Oken, Emily","Pedersen, Ole B.","Gudbjartsson, Daniel F.","Erikstrup, Christian","Sørensen, Erik","Lie, Rolv T.","McCarthy, Mark I.","Teramo, Kari","Hallman, Mikko","Nielsen, Henriette S."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-685399"],"filters":{"added":"2023-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"corpau":["Danish Blood Donor Study Genomic Consortium","Early Growth Genetics Consortium","Estonian Biobank Research Team"],"corresponding_author":["Solé-Navais, Pol"],"country":["Australia","Austria","Canada","Estonia","Finland","Iceland","Norway","Sweden","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Bristol Medical School","Case Western Reserve School of Medicine","Centre intégré universitaire de santé et de services sociaux (CIUSSS) du Saguenay-Lac-St-Jean - Hôpital Universitaire de Chicoutimi","Children's Hospital of Philadelphia","Cincinnati Children's Hospital Medical Center","Genentech Incorporated","Harvard Pilgrim Health Care Institute","Helsinki University Hospital","Hunter Medical Research Institute","Imperial College London","MRC Integrative Epidemiology Unit","Medical Research Center Oulu","Medical University of Vienna","Northwestern University Feinberg School of Medicine","Norwegian Institute of Public Health","Norwegian University of Science and Technology","Oulu University Hospital","Quantinuum Research LLC","School of Medicine and Public Health","South Australian Health and Medical Research Institute","Stanford University","The University of Queensland","University of Bergen","University of Cincinnati College of Medicine","University of Exeter","University of Gothenburg","University of Helsinki","University of Iceland","University of Oslo","University of Sherbrooke","University of South Australia","University of Tartu","University of Texas at Austin","Université de Sherbrooke, Faculté de Médecine et des Sciences de la Santé","Vanderbilt University","Wellcome Trust Centre for Human Genetics","deCODE genetics"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"OT":["Methods and Analysis"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"author correction genetic effects on the timing of parturition and links to feta