ohort study (PLOT-ICU)","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-091.33-715671","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"High entropy alloys (HEAs) are an important new material class with significant application potential in catalysis and electrocatalysis. The entropy-driven formation of HEA materials requires high temperatures and controlled cooling rates. However, catalysts in general also require highly dispersed materials, i.e., nanoparticles. Only then a favorable utilization of the expensive raw materials can be achieved. Several recently reported HEA nanoparticle synthesis strategies, therefore, avoid the high-temperature regime to prevent particle growth. In our work, we investigate a system of five noble metal single-source precursors with superior catalytic activity for the oxygen reduction reaction. Combining in situ X-ray powder diffraction with multi-edge X-ray absorption spectroscopy, we address the fundamental question of how single-phase HEA nanoparticles can form at low temperatures. It is demonstrated that the formation of HEA nanoparticles is governed by stochastic principles and the inhibition of precursor mobility during the formation process favors the formation of a single phase. The proposed formation principle is supported by simulations of the nanoparticle formation in a randomized process, rationalizing the experimentally found differences between two-element and multi-element metal precursor mixtures.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Pittkowski, Rebecca","Clausen, Christian M.","Chen, Qinyi","Stoian, Dragos","van Beek, Wouter","Bucher, Jan","Welten, Rahel L.","Schlegel, Nicolas","Mathiesen, Jette K.","Nielsen, Tobias M.","Du, Jia","Rosenkranz, Asger Wulff","Bøjesen, Espen Drath","Rossmeisl, Jan","Jensen, Kirsten Marie Ørnsbjerg","Arenz, Matthias"],"cuid":["S03-100.00-724533"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Arenz, Matthias","Jensen, Kirsten M Ø","Jensen, Kirsten Marie Ørnsbjerg","Pittkowski, Rebecca","Pittkowski, Rebecca K"],"country":["France","Switzerland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","European Synchrotron Radiation Facility","University of Bern"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Swiss Norwegian Beamline, European Synchrotron Radiation Facility (ESRF), Grenoble, France"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the more the better on the formation of single phase high entropy alloy nanoparticles as catalysts for the oxygen reduction reaction","src":["au","dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1039/D3EY00201B","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S03-100.00-724533","identifier":[{"id":"38013789","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85187570631","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC10621632","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-2e0de453-b926-4111-b456-db3ce65309f1","dtu-e1d3e655-ced0-4858-864a-cb908a0012fb","ku-408cb02a-42c3-4b79-a943-74797f7e23a6"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-4201E19D37FEB96C0B328B914526A624"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/383430782/d3ey00201b.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1039/D3EY00201B","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/345224351/d3ey00201b.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Chemistry, Department of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"fr","key":"european synchrotron radiation facility","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"European Synchrotron Radiation Facility","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Swiss Norwegian Beamline, European Synchrotron Radiation Facility (ESRF), Grenoble, France"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"ch","key":"university of bern","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Bern","used":1},{"affno":"5","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Physics, Surface Physics and Catalysis"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"6","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Rebecca K.","key":"pittkowskipau","last":"Pittkowski","locid":"448337eb-bd1c-4704-bc22-452c2f734a25","name":"Pittkowski, Rebecca K.","orcid":"0000-0002-0351-4993","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Christian M.","key":"clausenpau","last":"Clausen","locid":"f9f415e5-275f-48b1-9c73-6e18b9b7a578","name":"Clausen, Christian M.","rank":2