},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jibran","key":"khanpau","last":"Khan","locid":"c8fe96cd-050e-4aa9-8303-e03e7e92bf3e","name":"Khan, Jibran","orcid":"0000-0003-2080-2871","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6 7","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"münzelpau","last":"Münzel","name":"Münzel, Thomas","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ole","key":"raaschounielsenpau","last":"Raaschou-Nielsen","locid":"9ae8831f-2034-4c09-84bc-01cd649e3b55","name":"Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36334460"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.envint.2022.107570","issn":["01604120","18736750"],"issn_org":["01604120"],"journal":"Environment International","paperid":"107570","publisher":"Elsevier Ltd","status":"p","title":"Environment International","volume":"170"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85142429625"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Non-Profit Organisations","Other Research","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-c95d54a7-28aa-4059-9960-3e806709ae25","ruc-16cbdf8a-7824-469d-bc07-cae374953ef3"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Air pollution, road traffic noise and lack of greenness and risk of type 2 diabetes : A multi-exposure prospective study covering Denmark","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-027275","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Objective: Magnetic resonance imaging (MRI)-based techniques for non-invasive assessing liver iron concentration (LIC) in patients with iron overload have a limited upper measuring range around 35 mg/g dry weight, caused by signal loss from accelerated T1-, T2-, T2* shortening with increasing LIC. Expansion of this range is necessary to allow evaluation of patients with very high LIC. Aim: To assess measuring range of a gradient-echo R2* method and a T1-weighted spin-echo (SE), signal intensity ratio (SIR)-based method (TE = 25 ms, TR = 560 ms), and to extend the upper measuring range of the SIR method by optimizing echo time (TE) and repetition time (TR) in iron-loaded minipigs. Methods: Thirteen mini pigs were followed up during dextran-iron loading with repeated percutaneous liver biopsies for chemical LIC measurement and MRIs for parallel non-invasive estimation of LIC (81 examinations) using different TEs and TRs. Results: SIR and R2* method had similar upper measuring range around 34 mg/g and similar method agreement. Using TE = 12 ms and TR = 1200 ms extended the upper measuring range to 115 mg/g and yielded good method of agreement. Discussion: The wider measuring range is likely caused by lesser sensitivity of the SE sequence to iron, due to shorter TE, leading to later signal loss at high LIC, allowing evaluation of most severe hepatic iron overload. Validation in iron-loaded patients is necessary.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Jensen, Peter-Diedrich Matthias","Nielsen, Asbjørn Haaning","Simonsen, Carsten Wiberg","Jensen, Kenneth Krogh","Bøgsted, Martin","Jensen, Anne Birthe Helweg","Kjærgaard, Benedict"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-079035"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Jensen, Peter-Diedrich Matthias"],"keyword":["Experimental animal models","Iron overload","Magnetic Resonance Imaging","Quantitative imaging"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"biopsy based optimization and calibration of a signal intensity ratio based mri method 000000000001 000000000005 tesla in a dextran iron loaded mini pig model enabling estimation of very high liver iron concentrations","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10334-021-00998-x","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-079035","identifier":[{"id":"85123103758","type":"scopus"},{"id":"35038062","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-63c51aa8-7896-4091-b8e6-ff5651f57d0a"],"keyword":["Experimental animal models","Iron overload","Liver iron concentration","Magnetic resonance imaging","Quantitative imaging"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-648DDC558825494FBB100C2519464A36"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10334-021-00998-x","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/489570957/s10334_021_00998_x.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Haematology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Kirurgi og Kræftbehandling"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter D.","key":"jensenpeterdiedrichmatthiaspau","last":"Jensen","locid":"ff32942b-108d-4d07-be3e-fd0d93742de8","name":"Jensen, Peter-Diedrich Matthias","name_org":"Jensen, Peter D.","orcid":"0000-0003-3134-3973","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Asbjørn H.","key":"nielsenasbjørnhaaningpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"a8195f06-236e-45dc-a27c-e2125fceb03e","name":"Nielsen, Asbjørn Haaning","name_org":"Nielsen, Asbjørn H.","orcid":"0000-0003-4464-8549","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten W.","key":"simonsencarstenwibergpau","last":"Simonsen","locid":"b2945eb5-0825-4469-a4c6-19db32d9b140","name":"Simonsen, Carsten Wiberg","name_org":"Simonsen, Carsten W.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kenneth K.","key":"jensenkennethkroghpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"7f049bb5-8c06-4d93-9d29-51fc4cf022e0","name":"Jensen, Kenneth Krogh","name_org":"Jensen, Kenneth K.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Martin","key":"bøgstedmartinpau","last":"Bøgsted","locid":"a51116b7-e9b7-4f83-a74b-2d76bb8b1475","name":"Bøgsted, Martin","orcid":"0000-0001-9192-1814","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne B. H.","key":"jensenannebirthehelwegpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"e684f7f3-8392-4500-bbb0-76f623781c3b","name":"Jensen, Anne Birthe Helweg","name_org":"Jensen, Anne B. H.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Benedict","key":"kjærgaardbenedictpau","last":"Kjaergaard","locid":"3afc0400-089d-4805-be84-ecdf45e6e318","name":"Kjærgaard, Benedict","name_org":"Kjaergaard, Benedict","orcid":"0000-0001-5797-7638","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["35038062"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s10334-021-00998-x","issn":["09685243","13528661"],"issn_org":["09685243"],"issue":"5","journal":"Magnetic Resonance Materials in Physics, Biology and Medicine","pages":"843-859","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"Magnetic Resonance Materials in Physics, Biology and Medicine","volume":"35"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85123103758"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-63c51aa8-7896-4091-b8e6-ff5651f57d0a"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Biopsy-based optimization and calibration of a signal-intensity-ratio-based MRI method (1.5 Tesla) in a dextran-iron loaded mini-pig model, enabling estimation of very high liver iron concentrations","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-079035","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Many service systems such as transportation and logistics systems provide multimodal services with various resources, where how a service is provided to customers including the resources assigned to the service is often designed in advance of the service operations. However, due to increasing dynamics and uncertainty in certain situations, the needs for quickly designing and deploying ad hoc service systems in response to urgent and unexpected events occurred during the service provision have become significant. Motivated by this, we present a structural and functional design that supports Ad Hoc Multimodal Service System (AHMSS) deployment with a focus on a structure of the system, constraints governing the decisions involved in the system, and functions required for the system operation. The proposed design solution provides the basis for developing a decision support system for AHMSS deployment.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Sung, Inkyung","Buderath, Matthias","Nielsen, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-115573"],"event":{"end":"2021-10-08","place":"Salamanca, es","start":"2021-10-06","title":"18th International Symposium on Distributed Computing and Artificial Intelligence, DCAI 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Nielsen, Peter"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["Airbus Group","All Global Affiliations"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a structural and functional design for resource deployments in ad hoc multimodal service systems","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85115405710&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The research has been partially funded by Airbus Defence & Space."],"id":"S01-000.00-115573","identifier":[{"id":"85115405710","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-e152f760-cba5-40c1-8087-95c9bbec562a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A80D4EFA7D99026ED5220085A99903D6"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Materials and Production","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Materials and Production, Artificial Intelligence for Operations Research","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Materials and Production, Production","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, AI for the People"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"airbus group","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Airbus Group","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Inkyung","key":"sungpau","last":"Sung","locid":"0838305b-c1e4-48fa-9494-07506f4fc072","name":"Sung, Inkyung","orcid":"0000-0002-7045-8143","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Matthias","key":"buderathpau","last":"Buderath","name":"Buderath, Matthias","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"6e9311e7-df36-48ff-816c-ca6b88e405f0","name":"Nielsen, Peter","orcid":"0000-0002-4882-7942","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}