{"abstract":"Microbubble (MB) tracking plays an important role in ultrasound super-resolution imaging (SRI) by enabling velocity estimation and improving image quality. This work presents a new hierarchical Kalman (HK) tracker to achieve better performance at scenarios with high concentrations of MBs and high localization uncertainty. The method attempts to follow MBs with different velocity ranges using different Kalman filters. An extended simulation framework for evaluating trackers is also presented and used for comparison of the proposed HK tracker with the nearest-neighbor (NN) and Kalman (K) trackers. The HK tracks were most similar to the ground truth with the highest Jaccard similarity coefficient in 79% of the scenarios and the lowest root-mean-square error in 72% of the scenarios. The HK tracker reconstructed vessels with a more accurate diameter. In a scenario with an uncertainty of 51.2 μm in MB localization, a vessel diameter of 250 μm was estimated as 257 μm by HK tracker, compared with 329 μm and 389 μm for the K and NN trackers. In the same scenario, the HK tracker estimated MB velocities with a relative bias down to 1.7% and a relative standard deviation down to 8.3%. Finally, the different tracking techniques were applied to in vivo data from rat kidneys, and trends similar to the simulations were observed. Conclusively, the results showed an improvement in tracking performance, when the HK tracker was employed in comparison with the NN and K trackers.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Taghavi, Iman","Andersen, Sofie Bech","Hoyos, Carlos Armando Villagómez","Schou, Mikkel","Gran, Fredrik","Hansen, Kristoffer Lindskov","Nielsen, Michael Bachmann","Sørensen, Charlotte Mehlin","Stuart, Matthias Bo","Jensen, Jørgen Arendt"],"cuid":["S02-099.56-037765"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Taghavi, Iman"],"keyword":["Contrast enhanced ultrasound CEUS","Microbubble tracking","Microscopy","Super resolution imaging SRI","Ultrasound localization microscopy ULM"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ultrasound super resolution imaging with a hierarchical kalman tracker","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ultras.2022.106695","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-099.56-037765","identifier":[{"id":"35149256","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85124230932","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-e7f72fbb-c4a1-4cb1-9b45-d05417e6ac30","ku-1171123e-8f33-48b5-89ae-9860669f0936"],"keyword":["Contrast-enhanced ultrasound (CEUS)","Microbubble tracking","Microscopy","Super-resolution imaging (SRI)","Ultrasound localization microscopy (ULM)"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-C335AFCB27E26A7BAD43DB2D5F399ADD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ultras.2022.106695","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/299215373/1_s2.0_S0041624X22000105_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/269866247/1_s2.0_S0041624X22000105_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, UltraSound and Biomechanics","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, UltraSound and Biomechanics, Center for Fast Ultrasound Imaging"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Biomedical Sciences, Physiology of circulation, kidney and lung","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["BK Medical ApS"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Iman","key":"taghavipau","last":"Taghavi","locid":"70860894-0180-4faf-a270-c7e761b81abc","name":"Taghavi, Iman","orcid":"0000-0002-2551-074X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Sofie Bech","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"aa092fcb-de55-49f5-8772-31a2666a414b","name":"Andersen, Sofie Bech","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Carlos Armando Villagómez","key":"hoyospau","last":"Hoyos","name":"Hoyos, Carlos Armando Villagómez","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mikkel","key":"schoupau","last":"Schou","locid":"02abcc96-628c-467d-9117-1d3a80866a55","name":"Schou, Mik