{"abstract":"OBJECTIVE To investigate the association between long term residential exposure to road traffic and railway noise and risk of incident dementia. DESIGN Nationwide prospective register based cohort study. SETTING Denmark. PARTICIPANTS 1 938 994 adults aged >= 60 years living in Denmark between 1 January 2004 and 31 December 2017. MAIN OUTCOME MEASURES Incident cases of all cause dementia and dementia subtypes (Alzheimer's disease, vascular dementia, and Parkinson's disease related dementia), identified from national hospital and prescription registries. RESULTS The study population included 103 500 participants with incident dementia, and of those, 31 219 received a diagnosis of Alzheimer's disease, 8664 of vascular dementia, and 2192 of Parkinson's disease related dementia. Using Cox regression models, 10 year mean exposure to road traffic and railway noise at the most (L(den)max) and least (L(den)min) exposed facades of buildings were associated with a higher risk of all cause dementia. These associations showed a general pattern of higher hazard ratios with higher noise exposure, but with a levelling off or even small declines in risk at higher noise levels. In subtype analyses, both road traffic noise and railway noise were associated with a higher risk of Alzheimer's disease, with hazard ratios of 1.16 (95% confidence interval 1.11 to 1.22) for road Ldenmax >= 65 dB compared with = 55 dB compared with = 60 dB compared with = 50 dB compared with CONCLUSIONS This nationwide cohort study found transportation noise to be associated with a higher risk of all cause dementia and dementia subtypes, especially Alzheimer's disease.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Cantuaria, Manuella Lech","Waldorff, Frans Boch","Wermuth, Lene","Pedersen, Ellen Raben","Poulsen, Aslak Harbo","Thacher, Jesse Daniel","Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole","Ketzel, Matthias","Khan, Jibran","Valencia, Victor H.","Schmidt, Jesper Hvass","Sørensen, Mette"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-454717"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Surrey"],"keyword":["Air pollution","Alcohol consumption","Annoyance","Association","Cognitive impairment","Disease","ROAD","Risk","Stress","Traffic noise"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-CAN"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-NP-CAN","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"residential exposure to transportation noise in denmark and incidence of dementia national cohort study","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.n1954","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-454717","identifier":[{"id":"PMC8424489","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85114799096","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000702137100007","type":"wos"},{"id":"34497091","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-66a116e2-1788-47b6-8175-2b487f1c6819"],"keyword":["AIR-POLLUTION","ALCOHOL-CONSUMPTION","ANNOYANCE","ASSOCIATION","COGNITIVE IMPAIRMENT","DISEASE","RISK","ROAD","STRESS","TRAFFIC NOISE"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-7-2CCB23469EF30FD83A56632760CD620B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.n1954","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/281276213/Residential_exposure_to_transportation_noise_in_Denmark_and_incidence_of_dementia.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"dcrc danish cancer society research center","l2":"DI-NP","l2n":"Non-Profit Organisations","l3":"DI-NP-CAN","l3nn":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","namevar":["Danish Cancer Society"],"nora_code":"DI-NP-CAN","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, External Centres, Forskningsenheden for Almen Praksis"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["University of Southern Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"gb","key":"university of surrey","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Surrey","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Manuella Lech","key":"cantuariapau","last":"Cantuaria","name":"Cantuaria, Manuella Lech","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","first":"Frans Boch","key":"waldorffpau","last":"Waldorff","locid":"895410ef-1771-4e1d-a0a7-94ccef842d76","name":"Waldorff, Frans Boch","orcid":"0000-0002-7859-633X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Lene","key":"wermuthpau","last":"Wermuth","name":"Wermuth, Lene","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Ellen Raben","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Ellen Raben","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Aslak Harbo","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","name":"Poulsen, Aslak Harbo","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jesse Daniel","key":"thacherpau","last":"Thacher","name":"Thacher, Jesse Daniel","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ole","key":"raaschounielsenpau","last":"Raaschou-Nielsen","name":"Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"Matthias","key":"ketzelpau","last":"Ketzel","name":"Ketzel, Matthias","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","first":"Jibran","key":"khanpau","last":"Khan","name":"Khan, Jibran","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","first":"Victor H.","key":"valenciapau","last":"Valencia","name":"Valencia, Victor H.","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Jesper Hvass","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","name":"Schmidt, Jesper Hvass","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Mette","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Mette","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["34497091"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1136/bmj.n1954","issn":["0959535X"],"journal":"British Medical Journal","paperid":"1954","status":"p","title":"British Medical Journal","title_org":"British Medical Journal (Danish Edition)","volume":"374"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85114799096"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Non-Profit Organisations","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-66a116e2-1788-47b6-8175-2b487f1c6819"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Residential exposure to transportation noise in Denmark and incidence of dementia : national cohort study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-454717","yea