","name":"Pebody, Richard","rank":42,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Tyra G.","key":"krausepau","last":"Krause","name":"Krause, Tyra G.","rank":43,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"26","first":"Kåre","key":"mølbakpau","last":"Mølbak","locid":"d94c7db7-f909-4a03-bdb7-185bb3eb5a96","name":"Mølbak, Kåre","rank":44,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["32643601"],"pub":{"doi":"10.2807/1560-7917.es.2020.25.26.2001214","issn":["1025496X"],"issue":"26","journal":"Eurosurveillance","paperid":"2001214","status":"p","title":"Eurosurveillance","volume":"25"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85089395098"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-b0c383d4-0a60-4e16-9d9e-49d340dfed4f"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Excess all-cause mortality during the COVID-19 pandemic in Europe – preliminary pooled estimates from the EuroMOMO network, March to April 2020","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-499004","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"A deterministic source of coherent single photons is an enabling device for quantum information processing. Quantum dots in nanophotonic structures have been employed as excellent sources of single photons with the promise of scaling up towards multiple photons and emitters. It remains a challenge to implement deterministic resonant optical excitation of the quantum dot required for generating coherent single photons, since residual light from the excitation laser should be suppressed without compromising source efficiency and scalability. Here, we present a planar nanophotonic circuit that enables deterministic pulsed resonant excitation of quantum dots using two orthogonal waveguide modes for separating the laser and the emitted photons. We report a coherent and stable single-photon source that simultaneously achieves high-purity (g((2))(0)=0.0200.005), high-indistinguishability (V=96 +/- 2%), and >80% coupling efficiency into the waveguide. Such 'plug-and-play' single-photon source can be integrated with on-chip optical networks implementing photonic quantum processors.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Uppu, Ravitej","Eriksen, Hans T.","Nielsen, Henri Thyrrestrup","Ugurlu, Asli D.","Wang, Ying","Scholz, Sven","Wieck, Andreas D.","Ludwig, Arne","Lobl, Matthias C.","Warburton, Richard J.","Lodahl, Peter","Midolo, Leonardo","Schröder, Tim"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-509090"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany","Switzerland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Ruhr Univ Bochum, Ruhr University Bochum, Lehrstuhl Angew Festkorperphys","University of Basel"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"on chip deterministic operation of quantum dots in dual mode waveguides for a plug and play single photon source","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-020-17603-9","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-509090","identifier":[{"id":"000558642500002","type":"wos"},{"id":"85088804005","type":"scopus"},{"id":"32728025","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC7391626","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-c1c030a3-f3ed-404a-940c-f757ded38e4e"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B2C0AFA2C0A95402778F5E66595401C7"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/247497009/s41467_020_17603_9.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-020-17603-9","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Niels Bohr Institute, Quantop"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"ruhr univ bochum ruhr university bochum lehrstuhl angew festkorperphys","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Ruhr Univ Bochum, Ruhr University Bochum, Lehrstuhl Angew Festkorperphys","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"ch","key":"university of basel","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Basel","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Ravitej","key":"uppupau","last":"Uppu","locid":"e6644f00-14be-4981-b3c1-914bdeb2a474","name":"Uppu, Ravitej","orcid":"0000-0002-8052-9427","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Hans T.","key":"eriksenpau","last":"Eriks