es, Maged","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Tony","key":"fletcherpau","last":"Fletcher","name":"Fletcher, Tony","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Matthias","key":"greinerpau","last":"Greiner","name":"Greiner, Matthias","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Evangelia","key":"ntzanipau","last":"Ntzani","name":"Ntzani, Evangelia","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Neil","key":"pearcepau","last":"Pearce","name":"Pearce, Neil","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Marco","key":"vincetipau","last":"Vinceti","name":"Vinceti, Marco","rank":20,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Laura","key":"ciccolallopau","last":"Ciccolallo","name":"Ciccolallo, Laura","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Marios","key":"georgiadispau","last":"Georgiadis","name":"Georgiadis, Marios","rank":22,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Andrea","key":"gervelmeyerpau","last":"Gervelmeyer","name":"Gervelmeyer, Andrea","rank":23,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Thorhallur I.","key":"halldorssonpau","last":"Halldorsson","name":"Halldorsson, Thorhallur I.","rank":24,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["32831946"],"pub":{"doi":"10.2903/j.efsa.2020.6221","issn":["18314732"],"issue":"8","journal":"EFSA Journal","paperid":"e06221","publisher":"European Food Safety Authority  EFSA","publisher_org":"European Food Safety Authority (E F S A)","status":"p","title":"EFSA Journal","volume":"18"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-76f2e97b-bbbd-4d88-85f8-284931e0fc44","ku-dcb57aab-929c-4bd3-b0fc-2a2dfcc969af"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Draft for internal testing Scientific Committee guidance on appraising and integrating evidence from epidemiological studies for use in EFSA's scientific assessments","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-096.94-035321","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Few population-based epidemiological studies of adults have examined the relationship between air pollution and leukaemias. METHODS: Using Danish National Cancer Registry data and Danish DEHM-UBM-AirGIS system-modelled air pollution exposures, we examined whether particulate matter (PM2.5), black carbon (BC), nitrogen dioxide (NO2) and ozone (O3) averaged over 1, 5 or 10 years were associated with adult leukaemia in general or by subtype. In all, 14,986 adult cases diagnosed 1989–2014 and 51,624 age, sex and time-matched controls were included. Separate conditional logistic regression models, adjusted for sociodemographic factors, assessed exposure to each pollutant with leukaemias. RESULTS: Fully adjusted models showed a higher risk of leukaemia with higher 1-, 5- and 10-year-average exposures to PM2.5 prior to diagnosis (e.g. OR per 10 μg/m3 for 10-year average: 1.17, 95% CI: 1.03, 1.32), and a positive relationship with 1-year average BC. Results were driven by participants 70 years and older (OR per 10 μg/m3 for 10-year average: 1.35, 95% CI: 1.15–1.58). Null findings for younger participants. Higher 1-year average PM2.5 exposures were associated with higher risks for acute myeloid and chronic lymphoblastic leukaemia. CONCLUSION: Among older adults, higher risk for leukaemia was associated with higher residential PM2.5 concentrations averaged over 1, 5 and 10 years prior to diagnosis.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Puett, Robin","Harbo Poulsen, Aslak","Taj, Tahir","Ketzel, Matthias","Geels, Camilla","Brandt, Jørgen","Christensen, Jesper Heile","Sørensen, Mette","Roswall, Nina","Arthur Hvidtfeldt, Ulla","Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole"],"cuid":["S02-097.78-028684"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Puett, Robin"],"country":["United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University System of Maryland","University of Maryland","University of Surrey"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-CAN"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-NP-CAN","DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"relationship of leukaemias with long term ambient air pollution exposures in the adult danish population","src":["au","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41416-020-01058-2","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-097.78-028684","identifier":[{"id":"32939055","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85091133854","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC7722932","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-dce5d99f-0291-4e8f-9f4e-d5862e5fe383","ruc-321c2466-c6f0-4f82-8dfc-ea0f37e3bcab"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-4B03AF7716AEF644B7E37234A55F8F91"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/230082246/s41416_020_01058_2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/77359105/s41416_020_01058_2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41416-020-01058-2","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"us","key":"university system of maryland","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University System of Maryland","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"dcrc danish cancer society research center","l2":"DI-NP","l2n":"Non-Profit Organisations","l3":"DI-NP-CAN","l3nn":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"D