ando","orcid":"0000-0002-2157-5677","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Carlos Armando Villagómez","key":"hoyoscarlosarmandovillagómezpau","last":"Hoyos","name":"Hoyos, Carlos Armando Villagómez","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Marie Sand","key":"trabergmariesandpau","last":"Traberg","locid":"4da6fca0-b677-4b9a-a006-a87b72ac6ee3","name":"Traberg, Marie Sand","orcid":"0000-0001-7090-6607","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jacob Bjerring","key":"olesenjacobbjerringpau","last":"Olesen","locid":"024aaa55-d5a4-4763-8004-b2fb701dfd2b","name":"Olesen, Jacob Bjerring","orcid":"0000-0002-5169-1644","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Borislav Gueorguiev","key":"tomovborislavgueorguievpau","last":"Tomov","locid":"16c6d791-3a1a-47ad-a725-2da30c420dee","name":"Tomov, Borislav Gueorguiev","orcid":"0000-0003-4236-3056","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ramin","key":"moshaveghraminpau","last":"Moshavegh","locid":"3381a121-ecc6-4c8c-948d-1fa418c26bce","name":"Moshavegh, Ramin","orcid":"0000-0002-4037-7625","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Simon","key":"holbeksimonpau","last":"Holbek","locid":"6c16a7ef-4737-4380-a953-e8e8e0e0f25d","name":"Holbek, Simon","orcid":"0000-0002-1449-3251","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Matthias Bo","key":"stuartmatthiasbopau","last":"Stuart","locid":"38dcc60f-13b3-4e3c-9561-93e13906ad24","name":"Stuart, Matthias Bo","orcid":"0000-0003-0809-530X","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","first":"Caroline","key":"ewertsencarolinepau","last":"Ewertsen","locid":"51880e6f-4b00-4868-9005-6a0464367816","name":"Ewertsen, Caroline","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","first":"Kristoffer Lindskov","key":"hansenkristofferlindskovpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"13d27542-8511-49cf-aec4-45950ec963b0","name":"Hansen, Kristoffer Lindskov","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Carsten","key":"thomsencarstenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"3df25ea7-9eb3-4b95-9aca-5171b7d5870f","name":"Thomsen, Carsten","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten E.","key":"thomsencarstenepau","last":"Thomsen","name":"Thomsen, Carsten E.","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","first":"Michael Bachmann","key":"nielsenmichaelbachmannpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"6c91b654-63b7-4eeb-8a6e-ee4a2708020a","name":"Nielsen, Michael Bachmann","orcid":"0000-0002-9380-1688","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen Arendt","key":"jensenjørgenarendtpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"e197c9fc-743f-4736-8d06-3825897e0989","name":"Jensen, Jørgen Arendt","orcid":"0000-0002-7896-3136","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["29735315"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ultrasmedbio.2018.03.017","issn":["03015629","1879291X"],"issn_org":["03015629"],"issue":"8","journal":"Ultrasound in Medicine & Biology","pages":"1727-1741","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Ultrasound in Medicine & Biology","title_org":"Ultrasound in Medicine and Biology","volume":"44"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85046639785"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-fb4056cd-a01b-4be5-85ba-16d2f17cc9fd","ku-580d7af0-d1aa-4e0e-a5c7-33eede11404b"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Accuracy and Precision of a Plane Wave Vector Flow Imaging Method in the Healthy Carotid Artery","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.57-038154","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Focus on renewable energy sources and reduced unit costs has led to increased number of wind turbines (WTs). WT noise (WTN) is reported to be highly annoying at levels from 30 to 35 dB and up, whereas for traffic noise people report to be highly annoyed from 40 to 45 dB and up. This has raised concerns as to whether WTN may increase risk for major diseases, as exposure to traffic noise has consistently been associated with increased risk of cardiovascular disease and diabetes. We identified all Danish dwellings within a radius of 20 WT heights and 25% of all dwellings within 20–40 WT heights from a WT. Using detailed data on WT type and hourly wind data at each WT position and height, we estimated hourly outdoor and low frequency indoor WTN for all dwellings, aggregated as nighttime 1- and 5-year running means. Using nationwide registries, we identified a study population of 614,731 persons living in these dwellings in the period from 1996 to 2012, of whom 25,148 developed diabetes. Data were analysed using Poisson regression with adjustment for individual and area-levels covariates. We found no associations between long-term exposure to WTN during night and diabetes risk, with incidence rate ratios (IRRs) of 0.90 (95% confidence intervals (CI): 0.79–1.02) and 0.92 (95% CI: 0.68–1.24) for 5-year mean nighttime outdoor WTN of 36–42 and ≥ 42 dB, respectively, compared to < 24 dB. For 5-year mean nighttime indoor low frequency WTN of 10–15 and ≥ 15 dB we found IRRs of 0.90 (0.78–1.04) and 0.74 (95% CI: 0.41–1.34), respectively, when compared to and < 5 dB. The lack of association was consistent across strata of sex, distance to major road, validity of noise estimate and WT height. The present study does not support an association between nighttime WTN and higher risk of diabetes. However, there were only few cases in the highest exposure groups and findings need reproduction.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Poulsen, Aslak Harbo","Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole","Peña, Alfredo","Hahmann, Andrea N.","Nordsborg, Rikke Baastrup","Ketzel, Matthias","Brandt, Jørgen","Sørensen, Mette"],"cuid":["S03-096.55-020541"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corresponding_author":["Poulsen, Aslak Harbo"],"keyword":["Diabetes","Epidemiology","Wind turbine noise"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-CAN"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-NP-CAN","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"long term exposure to wind turbine noise at night and risk for diabetes a nationwide cohort study","src":["au","dtu","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85045546376","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-096.55-020541","identifier":[{"id":"85045546376","type":"scopus"},{"id":"29665463","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-6bea1894-5fac-4d69-adb0-cfecd7ca62c1","dtu-a5c03425-697b-436d-ba30-81915c86d10f","ruc-d060fb4a-0318-4182-a891-fbe8a9520718"],"keyword":["Diabetes","Epidemiology","Wind turbine noise"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-32762E8217292D574A75A32044213704"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"dcrc danish cancer society research center","l2":"DI-NP","l2n":"Non-Profit Organisations","l3":"DI-NP-CAN","l3nn":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","namevar":["Danish Cancer Society"],"nora_code":"DI-NP-CAN","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Environmental Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Wind Energy","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Wind Energy, Meteorology & Remote Sensing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of Science and Environment"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Aslak Harbo","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","name":"Poulsen, Aslak Harbo","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ole","key":"raaschounielsenpau","last":"Raaschou-Nielsen","locid":"9ae8831f-2034-4c09-84bc-01cd649e3b55","name":"Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Alfredo","key":"penadiazpau","last":"Pena Diaz","locid":"2292abbf-9c66-4504-a423-128432556c8c","name":"Peña, Alfredo","name_org":"Pena Diaz, Alfredo","orcid":"0000-0002-7900-9651","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Andrea N.","key":"hahmannpau","last":"Hahmann","locid":"c8315d00-83a0-43f3-85c8-cf51258cdc00","name":"Hahmann, Andrea N.","orcid":"0000-0001-8785-3492","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rikke Baastrup","key":"nordsborgpau","last":"Nordsborg","name":"Nordsborg, Rikke Baastrup","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Matthias","key":"ketzelpau","last":"Ketzel","locid":"798900d2-1d54-4c53-a4ca-671c12aa3015","name":"Ketzel, Matthias","orcid":"0000-0001-9519-1935","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen","key":"brandtpau","last":"Brandt","locid":"5f570c62-a5a5-4760-b7c7-8755b6e37ebf","name":"Brandt, Jørgen","orcid":"0000-0002-7580-9547","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","first":"Mette","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"5bf2a665-def4-499c-9c63-0c440da72e20","name":"Sørensen, Mette","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["29665463"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.envres.2018.03.040","issn":["00139351","10960953"],"issn_org":["00139351"],"journal":"Environmental Research","pages":"40-45","publisher":"Academic Press Inc.","status":"p","title":"Environmental Research","volume":"165"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85045546376"],"sdg":["3. Good Health and Well-being","7. Affordable and Clean Energy","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Non-Profit Organisations","Roskilde University","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-6bea1894-5fac-4d69-adb0-cfecd7ca62c1","dtu-a5c03425-697b-436d-ba30-81915c86d10f","ruc-d060fb4a-0318-4182-a891-fbe8a9520718"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","DTU Technical University of Denmark","RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Long-term exposure to wind turbine noise at night and risk for diabetes : A nationwide cohort study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-096.55-020541","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Special needs education is focusing on a complex interplay of cognitive (knowledge), physical (motor rehabilitation), and social (interaction) learning. There is a strong discrepancy between the institutional spaces in which learning takes place and the need for scaffolding these levels of learning. In this paper we present a first part of an ongoing collaboration with a special needs education facility for adolescents with congenital and acquired brain damage, that is interested in exploring the transformation of the institutional space into a smart learning ecosystem. We exemplify our research approach with a case study of a corridor in the institution that serves as a test bed for the involvement of all parties, i.e. residents, staff, management, in this transformation process.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Krummheuer, Antonia Lina","Rehm, Matthias","Lund, Maja K. L.","Nielsen, Karen N.","Rodil, Kasper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-111299"],"event":{"acronym":"SLERD","end":"2017-06-23","place":"Aveiro, pt","start":"2017-06-22","title":"2nd International Conference on Smart Learning Ecosystems and Regional Developments","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Brain injury","Smart learning","Social practice"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"reflecting on co creating a smart learning ecosystem for adolescents with congenital brain damage","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85022223254&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-111299","identifier":[{"id":"85022223254","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-d2fd2933-4450-49f1-a26b-22b4c3254a82"],"