Ole","key":"raaschounielsenpau","last":"Raaschou-Nielsen","locid":"9ae8831f-2034-4c09-84bc-01cd649e3b55","name":"Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28953453"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1289/ehp1272","issn":["00916765","15529924"],"issn_org":["00916765"],"issue":"9","journal":"Environmental Health Perspectives","pages":"097021","paperid":"097021","publisher":"Public Health Services, US Dept of Health and Human Services","status":"p","title":"Environmental Health Perspectives","volume":"125"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85032152401"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Non-Profit Organisations","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-45471175-8ae4-4324-acf4-a26ae9e2964a","au-b8ad7488-3035-4684-8cd9-7870a7af79a0","ku-0897e3af-e5e6-470b-935a-c184a1e34766"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Long-Term Exposure to Road Traffic Noise and Nitrogen Dioxide and Risk of Heart Failure : A Cohort Study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-100.00-003394","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"We present a general theoretical description that allows us to describe the influence of isotropic chemical shift in homonuclear and heteronuclear dipolar recoupling experiments in magic-angle-spinning solid-state NMR. Through a transformation of the Hamiltonian into an interaction frame with the combined radio-frequency irradiation and the isotropic chemical shift, we determine an effective Hamiltonian to first order with respect to the relevant internal nuclear spin interactions. This unravels the essential resonance conditions for efficient dipolar recoupling. Furthermore, we propose how to handle situations where the resonance conditions are not exactly fulfilled. To verify the general theoretical description, we compare numerical simulations using a time-sliced time-dependent Hamiltonian with simulations using the calculated effective Hamiltonian for propagation. The comparisons are exemplified for the homonuclear dipolar recoupling experiments C7 2 1 and POST-C7 2 1.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Shankar, Ravi","Ernst, Matthias","Madhu, P. K.","Vosegaard, Thomas","Nielsen, Niels Christian","Nielsen, Anders Bodholt"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-135857"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, South","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Nielsen, Anders Bodholt"],"country":["India","Switzerland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","ETH Zürich","Tata Institute of Fundamental Research"],"keyword":["ATOMIC RESOLUTION STRUCTURE","Amyloid fibrils","Nuclear magnetic resonance","ROTATING SOLIDS","SIMPSON","Simulation","Spectroscopy"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a general theoretical description of the influence of isotropic chemical shift in dipolar recoupling experiments for solid state nmr","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85016966666","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-135857","identifier":[{"id":"000399073300008","type":"wos"},{"id":"85016966666","type":"scopus"},{"id":"28390347","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-0b80e237-8a72-4170-851d-6e8dc7cd1ad6"],"keyword":["AMYLOID FIBRILS","ATOMIC-RESOLUTION STRUCTURE","NUCLEAR-MAGNETIC-RESONANCE","PULSE SEQUENCE","ROTATING SOLIDS","SIMPSON","SIMULATION","SPECTROSCOPY"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3AF76C304D062EC2C99ABEB4BB0FC471"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Chemistry","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center - INANO-Kemi, iNANO-huset"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"ch","key":"eth zürich","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"ETH Zürich","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"in","key":"tata institute of fundamental research","loc":["India","Asia, South"],"name":"Tata Institute of Fundamental Research","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ravi","key":"shankarravipau","last":"Shankar","locid":"8a892e99-a581-461c-83ef-7d4e76662335","name":"Shankar, Ravi","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Matthias","key":"ernstmatthiaspau","last":"Ernst","name":"Ernst, Matthias","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"P. K.","key":"madhupkpau","last":"Madhu","name":"Madhu, P. K.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas","key":"vosegaardthomaspau","last":"Vosegaard","locid":"24095b61-42fb-41c6-aa1f-7c622f454ed4","name":"Vosegaard, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0001-5414-4550","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels Christian","key":"nielsennielschristianpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"32a7422d-cc2f-4301-87c9-951639ed3662","name":"Nielsen, Niels Christian","orcid":"0000-0003-2978-4366","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders B.","key":"nielsenandersbodholtpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"208305fa-7b15-47d0-ab35-c1b2701a7698","name":"Nielsen, Anders Bodholt","name_org":"Nielsen, Anders B.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28390347"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1063/1.4979123","issn":["00219606","10897690"],"issn_org":["00219606"],"issue":"13","journal":"Journal of Chemical Physics","paperid":"134105","publisher":"American Institute of Physics","status":"p","title":"Journal of Chemical Physics","volume":"146"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85016966666"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-0b80e237-8a72-4170-851d-6e8dc7cd1ad6"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"A general theoretical description of the influence of isotropic chemical shift in dipolar recoupling experiments for solid-state NMR","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-135857","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"AirGIS and the semi-parametrized Operational Street Pollution Model (OSPM®) have been frequently used across the globe to assess local or street-scale air pollution. Recent developments in OSPM and new technological advances in geospatial tools have led towards an inception of a substantially revised version of the AirGIS exposure modelling system (AirGIS 2). The new prototype system uses open source software as the geospatial programming tools in a PostgreSQL/PostGIS database in conjunction with R scripts for pre-processing and post-processing of the datasets. This study provides an overview of the re-development, initial testing phase together with strengths, limitations and future prospects of the new system. AirGIS has been re-evaluated against various long-term and short-term field measurements. The present study gives a brief overview of the evaluation and shows the main results and conclusions derived from this validation.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Khan, Jibran","Ketzel, Matthias","Kakosimos, Konstantinos E.","Hvidtfeldt, Ulla Arthur","Sørensen, Mette","Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole","Brandt, Jørgen","Ellermann, Thomas","Jensen, Steen Solvang"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-138744"],"event":{"end":"2017-10-09","place":"Bologna, it","start":"2017-10-09","title":"18th International Conference on<br/>Harmonisation within Atmospheric Dispersion Modelling for Regulatory Purposes","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["AirGIS","Exposure assessment","GIS","OSPM"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-CAN"],"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-NP-CAN","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"towards airgis re development a gis based air pollution and human exposure modelling system","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.harmo.org/conferences/Proceedings/_Bologna/publishedSections/H18-108-Khan.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-138744","identifier":[{"id":"85047197382","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-10597254-c026-4d79-9b6b-4017f4e58366"],"keyword":["AirGIS","Exposure assessment","GIS","OSPM","PostgreSQL/PostGIS"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-BF14FF8BF702C216A5D24EF7C428057A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.harmo.org/conferences/Proceedings/_Bologna/publishedSections/H18-108-Khan.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Environmental Science, Department of Environmental Science - Atmospheric Emissions & Modelling"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"dcrc danish cancer society research center","l2":"DI-NP","l2n":"Non-Profit Organisations","l3":"DI-NP-CAN","l3nn":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","namevar":["Danish Cancer Society"],"nora_code":"DI-NP-CAN","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jibran","key":"khanpau","last":"Khan","locid":"c8fe96cd-050e-4aa9-8303-e03e7e92bf3e","name":"Khan, Jibran","orcid":"0000-0003-2080-2871","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Matthias","key":"ketzelpau","last":"Ketzel","locid":"798900d2-1d54-4c53-a4ca-671c12aa3015","name":"Ketzel, Matthias","orcid":"0000-0001-9519-1935","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Konstantinos E.","key":"kakosimospau","last":"Kakosimos","name":"Kakosimos, Konstantinos E.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ulla Arthur","key":"hvidtfeldtpau","last":"Hvidtfeldt","name":"Hvidtfeldt, Ulla Arthur","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Mette","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole","key":"raaschounielsenpau","last":"Raaschou-Nielsen","name":"Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen","key":"brandtpau","last":"Brandt","locid":"5f570c62-a5a5-4760-b7c7-8755b6e37ebf","name":"Brandt, Jørgen","orcid":"0000-0002-7580-9547","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas","key":"ellermannpau","last":"Ellermann","locid":"5e5a2168-23db-4863-b6d5-bda7dcb1f662","name":"Ellermann, Thomas","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Steen Solvang","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"0d52f91a-4eaa-46f9-ab5f-d7fd3c31440d","name":"Jensen, Steen Solvang","orcid":"0000-0001-5923-8441","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"journal":"proceedings of the 18th International Conference on Harmonisation within Atmospheric Dispersion Modelling for Regulatory Purposes","pages":"88-92","status":"p","title":"proceedings of the 18th International Conference on Harmonisation within Atmospheric Dispersion Modelling for Regulatory Purposes"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Non-Profit Organisations","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-10597254-c026-4d79-9b6b-4017f4e58366"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Towards AIRGIS Re-development – A GIS based air pollution and human exposure modelling system.","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-138744","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"We demonstrate a high-purity source of indistinguishable single photons using a quantum dot embedded in a nanophotonic waveguide. The source features a near-unity internal coupling efficiency and the collected photons are efficiently coupled off chip by implementing a taper that adiabatically couples the photons to an optical fiber. By quasiresonant excitation of the quantum dot, we measure a single-photon purity larger than 99.4% and a photon indistinguishability of up to 94±1% by using p-shell excitation combined with spectral filtering to reduce photon jitter. A temperature-dependent study allows pinpointing the residual decoherence processes, notably the effect of phonon broadening. Strict resonant excitation is implemented as well as another means of suppressing photon jitter, and the additional complexity of suppressing the excitation laser source is addressed. The paper opens a clear pathway towards the long-standing goal of a fully deterministic source of indistinguishable photons, which is integrated on a planar photonic chip.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Kirsanské, Gabija","Nielsen, Henri Thyrrestrup","Daveau, Raphaël Sura","Dreessen, Chris L","Pregnolato, Tommaso","Midolo, Leonardo","Tighineanu, Petru","Javadi, Alisa","Stobbe, Søren","Ludwig, Arne","Schott, Rüdiger","Wieck, Andreas D.","Park, Suk In","Song, J.D.","Kuhlmann, Andreas","Söllner, Immo","Löbel, Matthias","Warburton, R.J.","Lodahl, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-513503"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"indistinguishable and efficient single photons from a quantum dot in a planar nanobeam waveguide","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/184909460/PhysRevB.96.165306_1_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-513503","identifier":[{"id":"85038122113","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-c90b6329-5725-4a40-90b6-7ec55274f93f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-449E8A2D3215BF3C630A77C872C63C0C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/184909460/PhysRevB.96.165306_1_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"https://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/license.html","type":"rem","url":"http://arxiv.org/pdf/1701.08131","version":"Pre-print"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Niels Bohr Institute, Quantop"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Gabija","key":"kirsansképau","last":"Kirsanské","locid":"8f78a497-6a68-4663-9e8e-f56018d6854b","name":"Kirsanské, Gabija","orcid":"0000-0002-8766-4218","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Henri Thyrrestrup","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"d1c9c117-13f0-416f-8a09-e1a757f9c95d","name":"Nielsen, Henri Thyrrestrup","orcid":"0000-0001-8922-4462","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":""