Ultrasound in Medicine and Biology","volume":"43"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85023157546"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-d5d1c0e2-9aaa-4eb3-95ab-26f827f824e8","ku-111b2924-d178-46c7-8947-9c6293408e73"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Common Carotid Artery Flow Measured by 3-D Ultrasonic Vector Flow Imaging and Validated with Magnetic Resonance Imaging","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.53-037422","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
