{"abstract":"Establishing high-resolution structures of biological macromolecules in heterogeneous environments by MAS solid-state NMR is an important challenge where development of advanced experimental procedures is in high demand. Promising new methods take advantage of samples with extensive (2)H, (13)C, and (15)N isotope labelling, effectively diluting (1)H spins. In many cases, a sufficient amount of (1)H at exchangeable sites cannot be re-established during the purification procedure, hence it is necessary to exploit also the potential of (2)H as a starting point in pulse sequences, capitalizing on its short T1 as compared to (13)C, and to detect carbon or proton spins as appropriate. Here we present a new method that enables the required high-efficiency (2)H to (13)C or (15)N polarization transfer to be accomplished under the limited (2)H rf power conditions using current (1)H, (2)H, (13)C and (15)N quadruple-resonance MAS NMR instrumentation.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Jain, Sheetal Kumar","Nielsen, Anders B","Hiller, Matthias","Handel, Liselotte","Ernst, Matthias","Oschkinat, Hartmut","Akbey, Ümit","Nielsen, Niels Christian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-135536"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"low power polarization transfer between deuterons and spin 000000000001 000000000002 nuclei using adiabatic respiration cp in solid state nmr","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1039/c3cp54419b","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-135536","identifier":[{"id":"24418905","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84892709326","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-0af279f8-751c-4301-af66-7e9bdf6779a9"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1CFEF02583CAB3A63BDDA0541A3C598F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1039/c3cp54419b","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University (AU)","Aarhus University, Aarhus University, Faculty of Science, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center - INANO-Kemi, Langelandsgade"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sheetal K","key":"jainsheetalkumarpau","last":"Jain","locid":"53d833f4-0297-47e2-a718-ca6cc6c6cf7d","name":"Jain, Sheetal Kumar","name_org":"Jain, Sheetal K","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders B","key":"nielsenandersbpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Anders B","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Matthias","key":"hillermatthiaspau","last":"Hiller","name":"Hiller, Matthias","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Liselotte","key":"handelliselottepau","last":"Handel","name":"Handel, Liselotte","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Matthias","key":"ernstmatthiaspau","last":"Ernst","name":"Ernst, Matthias","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Hartmut","key":"oschkinathartmutpau","last":"Oschkinat","name":"Oschkinat, Hartmut","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ümit","key":"akbeyümitpau","last":"Akbey","locid":"1755f895-0064-4017-8497-416600ccf2e1","name":"Akbey, Ümit","orcid":"0000-0003-3161-2969","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels Christian","key":"nielsennielschristianpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"32a7422d-cc2f-4301-87c9-951639ed3662","name":"Nielsen, Niels Christian","orcid":"0000-0003-2978-4366","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24418905"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1039/c3cp54419b","issn":["14639076","14639084"],"issn_org":["14639076"],"issue":"7","journal":"Physical Chemistry Chemical Physics","pages":"2827-30","publisher":"Royal Society of Chemistry","status":"p","title":"Physical Chemistry Chemical Physics","volume":"16"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84892709326"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-0af279f8-751c-4301-af66-7e9bdf6779a9"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Low-power polarization transfer between deuterons and spin-1/2 nuclei using adiabatic (RESPIRATION)CP in solid-state NMR","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-135536","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Exposure to road traffic noise and air pollution have both been associated with risk for stroke. The few studies including both exposures show inconsistent results. We aimed to investigate potential mutual confounding and combined effects between road traffic noise and air pollution in association with risk for stroke. In a population-based cohort of 57,053 people aged 50-64 years at enrollment, we identified 1999 incident stroke cases in national registries, followed by validation through medical records. Mean follow-up time was 11.2 years. Present and historical residential addresses from 1987 to 2009 were identified in national registers and road traffic noise and air pollution were modeled for all addresses. Analyses were done using Cox regression. A higher mean annual exposure at time of diagnosis of 10µg/m(3) nitrogen dioxide (NO2) and 10dB road traffic noise at the residential address was associated with ischemic stroke with incidence rate ratios (IRR) of 1.11 (95% CI: 1.03, 1.20) and 1.16 (95% CI: 1.07, 1.24), respectively, in single exposure models. In two-exposure models road traffic noise (IRR: 1.15) and not NO2 (IRR: 1.02) was associated with ischemic stroke. The strongest association was found for combination of high noise and high NO2 (IRR=1.28; 95% CI=1.09-1.52). Fatal stroke was positively associated with air pollution and not with traffic noise. In conclusion, in mutually adjusted models road traffic noise and not air pollution was associated ischemic stroke, while only air pollution affected risk for fatal strokes. There were indications of combined effects.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Sørensen, Mette","Lühdorf, Pernille","Ketzel, Matthias","Andersen, Zorana J","Tjønneland, Anne","Overvad, Kim","Raaschou-Nielsen, Ole"],"cuid":["S03-100.00-010585"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-CAN"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-NP-CAN","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"combined effects of road traffic noise and ambient air pollution in relation to risk for stroke","src":["aau","au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.envres.2014.05.011","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-100.00-010585","identifier":[{"id":"84901757741","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000339705900008","type":"wos"},{"id":"24906068","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-de1e7133-d9c2-4b75-be70-0f60161f7855","au-a5357b6d-7fcb-443f-a0b8-12fbb68d73ea","ku-a443d771-8095-4457-8833-69b8213f3763"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-92F368D4160A86A7D9264E0525AD3612"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.envres.2014.05.011","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"dcrc danish cancer society research center","l2":"DI-NP","l2n":"Non-Profit Organisations","l3":"DI-NP-CAN","l3nn":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DCRC Danish Cancer Society Research Center","namevar":["Danish Cancer Society"],"nora_code":"DI-NP-CAN","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of 