,"rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"7","corresponding":null,"first":"Yngve","key":"stenstrømpau","last":"Stenstrøm","name":"Stenstrøm, Yngve","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Armin","key":"wisthalerpau","last":"Wisthaler","name":"Wisthaler, Armin","rank":20,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788242523570"],"pages":"146","place":"Norge","publisher":"Norsk Institutt for Luftforskning","status":"p","volume":"OR2"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-ebb0a456-c95f-45c6-8813-b0ed6f59ad54"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Atmospheric Degradation of Amines (ADA) : Summary Report: Photo-Oxidation of Methylamine, Dimethylamine and Trimethylamine","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-263863","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Cosmopolitan occurrence of a lot of antibiotics and other bioactives among microorganisms, stresses the need for efficient of dynamic screening and dereplication methods to avoid redundancy in isolation of compounds. Exploring our large collection of marine bacteria collected during the Galathea 3 expedition,1 we use a combination of chemical profiling2 and explorative solid-phase extraction (E-SPE)3 to assess the bacteria’s potential to produce new and interesting molecules. We found the use of chemical profiling by LC-UV/MS very useful for marine bacteria such as Vibrio4 and Pseudoalteromonas.5 It enabled the grouping of similar strains at species and subspecies level disregarding geographical sampling locations. However, intraspecies differences were still observed. In P. luteoviolacea5 and V. coralliilyticus6 some of the differences were related to the production of antibacterial compounds. The chemical profile could be linked to a bioactivity profile using E-SPE,3 which through the use of three different ion-exchangers and a size-exclusion column gives information about the charge, size, and polarity of active components in an extract. This can be used to discriminate between possible candidates during dereplication and allows detailed mapping of bioactives.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Månsson, Maria","Vynne, Nikolaj Grønnegaard","Wietz, Matthias","Gram, Lone","Nielsen, Kristian Fog","Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-345047"],"event":{"end":"2011-08-03","place":"San Diego, us","start":"2011-07-30","title":"The American Society of Pharmacognosy Annual Meeting 2011","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"screening and dereplication of microbial natural products extracts","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/6379300/prod21325510369193.ASP_MariaMansson2.doc.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-345047","ids":["dtu-87a3f0f6-fad0-48aa-afbb-6c6f15a0c734"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-75CB9068BC7BC8890A6CB3C0F367F096"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/6379300/prod21325510369193.ASP_MariaMansson2.doc.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.pharmacognosy.us/","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology, Center for Microbial Biotechnology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Maria","key":"månssonpau","last":"Månsson","locid":"b544bec6-c495-4e6d-8b22-b1a749699479","name":"Månsson, Maria","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nikolaj Grønnegaard","key":"vynnepau","last":"Vynne","locid":"671bfb38-eace-444f-a072-d669c9febefa","name":"Vynne, Nikolaj Grønnegaard","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Matthias","key":"wietzpau","last":"Wietz","locid":"f8928597-cfad-401a-84d2-07faf1cbbda3","name":"Wietz, Matthias","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lone","key":"grampau","last":"Gram","locid":"9fabd1ae-e28f-4a5d-8456-7a075b4aa34e","name":"Gram, Lone","orcid":"0000-0002-1076-5723","rank":4,"role